# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values. NEVER commit the real .env file.
#
# No environment variables are required.
#
# OpenResume is entirely client-side: it performs no network requests, has no
# backend, no authentication, and no analytics. Documents stay in memory for
# the current session; only the interface theme is stored in localStorage.
# This file exists to keep the repository layout consistent with ecosystem
# standards; there is nothing to configure.
